<title>UK: Citibank sets $665 million two-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets $665 million two-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following asset backed bond was announced by lead manager Citibank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITIBANK CCMT 97-2</p>
<p> TRANCHE A:</p>
<p> AMT    $625 MLN	COUPON     **	  LEG MAT     16.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  EXP MAT     15.FEB.02</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    **	  SPREAD +30 BP AREA</p>
<p>TRANCHE B: LEAD MANAGER MERRILL LYNCH.</p>
<p> AMT    $40 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MOODY/S&amp;P   A2/A</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  SPREAD +45 BP AREA</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    **</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX</p>
<p>SPREAD OVER FIVE-YEAR W/I U.S. TREASURIES.</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND =  NOTES	=</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
